      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "minimax-h3-audio-T8"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "S25 Motion Recovery separate-stage EXP example; not quality accepted. Pass 1 remains the old Stock20 source generation. Pass 2 independently binds the retimed motion source and uses only the selected external Relay/EAV branches. The original Motion Recover, AutoGate and pass-1 audio default remain in place. Full-save and Freeze-first require an explicit confirm_save before a native checkpoint is written. Cold-second requires the exact checkpoint path, manifest and whole-file SHA; it has no first-pass sampler. Replace example prompt and verify local model assets. A cold graph does not auto-accept generated quality."
      ]
    },
